01:47:39.040  w   measure WHITE target (dial) under current light
01:47:39.041  y   measure YELLOW target (needle) under current light
01:47:39.041  i   toggle light source: white board LED / external blue LED
01:47:39.041  g   cycle TCS34725 gain 1x / 4x / 16x / 60x
01:47:39.052  r   report contrast and SNR
01:47:39.052  l   toggle live readout on OLED and serial
