01:47:39.053  j   toggle JSON output for the lab software
01:47:39.053  m   measure one point, the software supplies the label
01:47:39.074  n   cycle samples per half series 10 / 25 / 50 / 100
01:47:39.074  k   run the countdown on the display
01:47:39.075  p   print status
01:47:39.075  h   this help
